# Development files
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Test files
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/test/
**/tests/
**/__tests__/

# Documentation
docs/
*.md
README.md

